{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;The Legend of Nezha&quot;, players will transform into the owner of an inn. They will have a complete and rich set of service functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will meticulously simulate various massage techniques, which can all be precisely applied to the game characters through the players' operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can help the guests with massages by simply clicking the mouse, relieving their fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes hot spring scenes and restaurant scenes, which can enable players to be more immersed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a rich mission system in the game. Players can complete missions to obtain generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, there is a free lucky draw turntable, which provides players with a rich gaming experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620000?t=1755335936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620000/0276636d549e9a03bc93924775389cbbcd6d9048/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755335936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620000/fc6ff9a40fcf4187439736269dd4f5e22834adc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755335936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620000/fc6ff9a40fcf4187439736269dd4f5e22834adc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755335936","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;The Legend of Nezha&quot;, players will transform into the owner of an inn. They will have a complete and rich set of service functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will meticulously simulate various massage techniques, which can all be precisely applied to the game characters through the players' operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can help the guests with massages by simply clicking the mouse, relieving their fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes hot spring scenes and restaurant scenes, which can enable players to be more immersed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a rich mission system in the game. Players can complete missions to obtain generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, there is a free lucky draw turntable, which provides players with a rich gaming experience.</p>","developers":["\u54ea\u5412\u4f20\u5947"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620000/092e74e5d0b03db553aa8d007741e19682eb26e5/header.jpg?t=1755335936","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620000/563322994/72db2ba973daaa836b1f945280ff14ba6b732b45/1750454510/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750217027","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620000/563322994/72db2ba973daaa836b1f945280ff14ba6b732b45/1750454510/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750217027","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620000/563322994/72db2ba973daaa836b1f945280ff14ba6b732b45/1750454510/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750217027","id":257118302,"name":"\u54ea\u5412\u4f20\u5947\u73a9\u6cd5\u4ecb\u7ecd","thumbnail":"https://sh